      "When a client decides to leave, ask briefly and kindly why. A two-question message works: 'What made you decide to stop?' and 'Is there anything I could have done differently?' Some won't answer, but those who do give you the most useful feedback you'll get. Thank them, wish them well and let them know they're welcome back.",
